WEBVTT

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:04.480
Oh, wow!

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:06.260
Ooh, it's us!

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.980
I's so cu'e!

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:09.750
Pika Pika Pop?!

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.910
Are mew doing something with them?

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:15.190
We're doing a collaboration with this brand.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:16.650
With merchandise and everything!

00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:19.420
...Mew're so lucky...

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:23.010
I's for ge'in' the wor' ou' for our CD.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:23.870
Precisely.

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:28.030
For the duration of the collaboration,
their stores will only play songs by Dekoration.

00:00:28.030 --> 00:00:31.910
When releasing a CD,
...the more exposure you have, the better—

00:00:31.910 --> 00:00:33.540
P's a pervert!

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.150
I'm gonna tell my sister!

00:00:38.110 --> 00:00:40.200
Are you a pervert, Producer?

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.260
...Uh, no...

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:46.340
P's talkin' abou' me'ia exposure.

00:00:46.670 --> 00:00:48.930
Oh, <i>that</i> kind.

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:50.790
That kind? What's that kind?

00:00:50.790 --> 00:00:52.950
Maybe when mew're a little older, Miria.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:53.520
Huh?

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:58.170
I'd be totally okay with
the <i>other</i> kind of exposure too.

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:00.020
Whatever you want, P.

00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:02.230
So cool!

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:05.610
I'll keep that in mind.

00:01:05.990 --> 00:01:08.450
P, that's all you ever say!

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:09.740
My apologies.

00:01:08.780 --> 00:01:11.020
They are having the fun.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.490
They're just toying with him.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:18.570
You will appear at an event
commemorating the merchandise sale.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:19.680
An event?!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:20.580
A concert?!

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:25.170
Unfortunately, it will not be
in a place where you can sing.

00:01:25.170 --> 00:01:26.500
It will be a talk show.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.010
Aw, come on. That's so boring.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:29.880
What's a talk show?

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:31.360
...Uh...

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.470
It's where we talk about stuff
behind the scenes and stuff like that.

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:36.480
Oh, how embarrassin'!

00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:39.030
Do we have to talk about
embarrassing things?

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.510
...Like...

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.100
The first time you did "blank".

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:45.070
"Blank"?

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.530
We'll have a meeting about the
content of the show in the near future.

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:51.230
Okay!

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:53.040
You think they'll be okay?

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.000
I'm getting meowre worried by the meownite.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:34.470
And we're back!

00:03:34.470 --> 00:03:37.220
Next up, we have Dekoration!

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:40.070
Hi! I'm Rika!

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:42.870
Hello! I'm Akagi Miria!

00:03:42.870 --> 00:03:45.860
Everybo'y! I'm Kirari!

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.430
...One, two...

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:49.930
We're Dekoration!

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:50.990
You're so cute!

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:53.250
Thank you!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.370
We're super duper happy you could all come!

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:00.870
Le's have a lo' of fun toge'er!

00:04:00.870 --> 00:04:04.920
Aren't the Dekoration
collaboration goods real cute?

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:09.840
Pika Pika Pop's clothes
are all so cu'e, hear'hrob!

00:04:09.840 --> 00:04:13.430
We're so happy we coul'
have this collaboration!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:17.550
I thought they'd be too cute for me,

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:19.140
but I look good, don't I?

00:04:19.440 --> 00:04:21.730
You look great, Rika!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:23.340
Super cute!

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.100
Naturally!

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:29.180
They go on sale today,
so check them out, everyone.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:36.720
I've been meaning to ask, but doesn't the
"Deko" part of "Dekoration" look kind of funny?

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:37.910
Yup.

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:40.370
It's what we look like
if you line us up like this.

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:46.880
And our ages too! I'm eleven,
Rika's twelve, and Kirari's seventeen!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:48.360
Yup, yup!

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.840
Middle schooler here!

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:53.070
So is Kirari the leader of the group?

00:04:53.070 --> 00:04:55.450
Yeah! We're always counting on her!

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:58.220
Shu's, tha' ma'es me happy!

00:05:02.050 --> 00:05:05.230
We will ride in the van to the
next venue once it is loaded.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:09.650
But first, good work on your first talk show.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:11.250
Than's a bunch!

00:05:11.250 --> 00:05:12.900
How'd we do, P?

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:14.530
Did we do okay?

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:16.350
Yes.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:20.740
Your fans enjoyed the event.
I think you did very well.

00:05:20.740 --> 00:05:22.540
For their first time, anyway.

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:25.190
You pass, I guess.

00:05:25.190 --> 00:05:26.970
...Excuse me, but only staff—

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:27.790
Sis!

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:30.650
You said you were working!

00:05:30.650 --> 00:05:33.550
I had some time, so I dropped by.

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:35.760
Jougasaki?

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:36.730
You got it!

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:38.040
So I'm like staff, right?

00:05:40.180 --> 00:05:43.190
Rika, you kept glancing at Producer.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.550
Focus on the audience.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:46.720
...Okay...

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:50.770
As for Kirari, everyone loves
your personality, so you need to speak up.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:52.580
Spea' up?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.030
Mika, what about me?

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:57.130
Miria, you were too good a girl up there.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.280
Well, it was really cute, so good job.

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:01.930
What about me?!

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:05.350
I'll try to talk a lot more
for our next show!

00:06:05.350 --> 00:06:06.410
Me too!

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:08.540
Do your best.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.080
You have any thoughts, Producer?

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:15.090
Perhaps you could try getting
more audience participation?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:20.930
Not just from your fans, but perhaps
something that would attract passers-by.

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:22.500
I thought the same thing!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:25.410
It's kinda sad when people just walk by.

00:06:25.410 --> 00:06:27.580
But what can we do?

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:28.180
...Nyohm...

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:30.680
We could go beetle hunting with everyone!

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.790
It's not that kind of event.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.330
Now get ready to go.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:35.320
Okay.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.700
We will be heading there now.

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:39.820
Yes. Thank you very much.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.820
What are you planning for the next show?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:48.780
I'd like them to continue
doing as they please.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.780
What the heck?

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:50.580
Did you give up?

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:51.860
No.

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:56.460
I believe that Dekoration will
perform best if given complete freedom.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:59.280
I'd like to try this approach.

00:07:01.030 --> 00:07:04.970
If you say so.
It's <i>your</i> responsibility, after all.

00:07:06.110 --> 00:07:06.970
Right.

00:07:09.430 --> 00:07:11.480
...Happy-happy with everybo'y...

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:17.080
Would they listen if we asked them to?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.780
What if we went sexy?

00:07:19.150 --> 00:07:23.410
Listen to us, and we'll give you a re-ward.

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.270
A reward for listening to us?

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:27.580
Anything but that, please.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:33.330
How can we get the audience to participate?

00:07:33.330 --> 00:07:36.090
I can't think of anything!

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.910
P, help us out!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.840
Hey, everybo'y!
Why don' we go have some crepes?

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:44.290
Crepes?

00:07:44.290 --> 00:07:47.560
Swee' snacks for brain max!

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:50.930
We migh' even come up wi' an idea!

00:07:50.930 --> 00:07:53.450
I want one! Let's go, let's go!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.380
Me too! Me too!

00:07:56.530 --> 00:08:01.460
P, we'll ma'e i' quick, so can we?

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:03.940
...Let's see...

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:05.920
We still have some time.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.620
Perhaps it will provide a change of pace.

00:08:08.620 --> 00:08:09.830
Yay!

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:14.420
We will proceed directly to the venue.

00:08:14.420 --> 00:08:15.250
Got it.

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.450
P, hurry up!

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:17.590
Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.960
Thanks!

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:23.720
Wow!

00:08:24.090 --> 00:08:25.840
It's a huge cake!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:27.590
P, take a picture!

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:28.260
Very well.

00:08:30.280 --> 00:08:30.970
Taking it now.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:32.890
Say "cheese".

00:08:37.310 --> 00:08:39.100
Thanks!

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:42.370
I should've brought my phone too.

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:43.830
I'll send you a copy.

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.900
I'll put it on the blog too.

00:08:45.900 --> 00:08:46.970
I see.

00:08:48.230 --> 00:08:52.450
May I take your pictures
for the project homepage?

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:53.700
Sure!

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.240
Make me look cute, 'kay?

00:08:55.740 --> 00:09:00.330
All righ'! I'll show you aroun'!

00:09:13.430 --> 00:09:14.560
...One, two...

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:16.280
Ranko!

00:09:18.310 --> 00:09:19.060
Taking it now.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:20.980
Darkness envelops me!

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.570
This is so much fun!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:27.890
Rika, is this your firs' time here?

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:30.530
Yeah! I usually go to Ikebukuro.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:31.450
Huh?

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:33.350
I smell something sweet!

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:34.650
Crepes?

00:09:34.650 --> 00:09:36.080
Righ' this way!

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:40.510
You want a bite?

00:09:40.510 --> 00:09:41.400
Yep!

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:43.730
Yuka-Yuka, let's have these doughnuts after!

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:44.570
Sounds good!

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:48.470
Nyeah! Which one shoul' I ge'?

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:50.670
I want one with strawberries!

00:09:50.670 --> 00:09:53.080
Should I get chocolate banana?

00:09:53.690 --> 00:09:55.690
I can purchase them once you've decided.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.380
What? Really?

00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.730
They fall under entertainment expenses.

00:09:58.730 --> 00:10:01.730
Entertainment? P, how could you?

00:10:01.730 --> 00:10:05.490
Entertainment? Like on a date?

00:10:05.490 --> 00:10:06.690
It's a date! It's a date!

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:07.590
It's a date! It's a date!

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:08.990
...No, um...

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:10.870
Enjoy.

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.360
Thanks! It looks yummy!

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:14.960
Thank you so much!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.750
A crepe!

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:18.210
Oh!

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:19.370
P, P!

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:21.130
Wanna ta'e a bi'e firs'?

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:22.130
Huh?

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.030
You can have a bite of mine too.

00:10:25.030 --> 00:10:26.010
Producer,

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:28.130
say, "Aah".

00:10:28.490 --> 00:10:30.130
...No, please...

00:10:30.550 --> 00:10:33.050
Do not mind me. Please enjoy.

00:10:33.050 --> 00:10:34.620
You sure?

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:35.890
Let's dig in!

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:37.430
Okay!

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:39.520
Ready, set, go!

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:45.270
What's up with him?

00:10:45.270 --> 00:10:46.370
Should we call the cops?

00:10:48.880 --> 00:10:52.480
Why don't we ask the audience
about their favorite crepe toppings?

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:54.670
Nyeah, yeah! Goo' i'ea!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.660
...Producer—

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:58.250
What are you doing back there?

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.670
He said that we stand out
too much if he's too close.

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:03.560
He's li'e a bo'yguar'! So cool!

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:06.920
Huh? More like totally sketchy.

00:11:08.290 --> 00:11:09.670
This one's so cute!

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.000
Which one?

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.090
These are cu'e too!

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:18.520
Yes?

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.640
Mind coming with me?

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:22.070
Huh?

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.150
"Snap"?

00:11:23.150 --> 00:11:25.940
Yes. Here's our card.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:28.040
Mind if we took a picture?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:29.820
Just Kirari? No fair!

00:11:30.340 --> 00:11:31.550
Take one of me too!

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.740
That camera's so cool!

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:34.240
...Um...

00:11:34.510 --> 00:11:36.690
...Wait, are you—

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:37.660
That's right!

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.930
Dekoration's first single, now on sale!

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.620
We hope you'll give it a listen!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.410
Run for it!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.810
Excuse us.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:49.960
Wai' for me!

00:11:52.970 --> 00:11:54.720
That was exciting!

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:57.250
We're the real deal, after all!

00:11:57.250 --> 00:12:00.320
You can' jus' run off, girls.

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:01.780
Sorry.

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:06.900
But isn't our producer supposed
to help out in those situations?

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:09.400
P?

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.290
Huh?

00:12:10.290 --> 00:12:11.940
Producer?

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:16.200
I was not taking unauthorized photographs.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:19.930
But you were pointing
your phone at some girls, right?

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.080
As part of my job.

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:22.970
What job's that?

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.340
...I'm a producer. Here is my card—

00:12:26.100 --> 00:12:29.090
My apologies. I gave away
my last card this morning.

00:12:29.380 --> 00:12:31.050
Yeah, of course you did.

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:32.880
Producer's lost!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:35.010
I'll call him.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.400
Excuse me. May I answer?

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.100
No way. You're just gonna delete the data.

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:47.020
P's not answering!

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:49.230
I'll call the agency.

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:53.460
Yes. One second please.

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.890
This is Nitta from the Cinderella Project.

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:58.240
Is Senkawa Chihiro available?

00:12:58.820 --> 00:13:00.240
Yes. That's right.

00:13:00.690 --> 00:13:01.490
What's up?

00:13:02.020 --> 00:13:05.000
Producer's with the police!

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:05.790
What?

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:06.870
My friend?

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:08.730
I-It's an emergency!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:10.340
...Um... um...

00:13:10.340 --> 00:13:12.350
Someone call 9-1-1!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.340
Calm down.

00:13:14.380 --> 00:13:15.970
...I's busy...

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:17.680
What should we do?

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:18.910
Sis?

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:19.720
...P's...

00:13:21.220 --> 00:13:22.220
What?!

00:13:22.220 --> 00:13:24.060
Okay, I'll be there in a minute.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:26.930
Sorry, gotta run!

00:13:26.930 --> 00:13:29.220
What about karaoke?

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.480
See ya!

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:34.150
What the heck is he thinking?!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:40.170
The number you have dialed is currently
...outside of its service area or...

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:41.490
No use. Maybe he turned it off?

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:44.550
What happened to P?

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:46.500
I'm sorry.

00:13:47.300 --> 00:13:50.750
We got separated because we ran off.

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:54.460
Hug-hug!

00:13:55.630 --> 00:13:57.080
I's okay!

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.550
Le's go back where we
came from an' loo' for P!

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:05.280
This whole town's my turf,
so we'll fin' him quick!

00:14:06.070 --> 00:14:07.060
Okay!

00:14:08.750 --> 00:14:11.310
It's good to see you, Producer.

00:14:11.790 --> 00:14:14.070
My apologies. Thank you very much.

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:21.950
...Hello—

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:28.290
Minami, did P go back there?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:31.160
...We got separated...

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:31.510
Sis? You're at the station?

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:34.500
Okay. Um... Where are we?

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:37.730
Okay, got it.

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:39.260
Can you come to the station?

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.640
...Wait a sec, Kirari—

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:44.620
P's with the police?!

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:45.750
The police?!

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:47.560
We're heading there now! Bye!

00:14:47.560 --> 00:14:49.320
...Wait, Rika—

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:53.440
The <i>police</i>?!

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.260
Search for them?

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.150
All over town?

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.660
They couldn't have gone far.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:14:59.900
Please wait!

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:03.120
I think it's best to
try and contact them first.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:04.450
...But—

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:08.830
What if you do get through,
and they've gone the opposite direction?

00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:12.100
They're not children.

00:15:12.610 --> 00:15:13.580
...Right...

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:16.300
He's not here!

00:15:16.300 --> 00:15:17.300
Not here?!

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:22.300
When you say "with the police",
you mean the police <i>station</i>, right?!

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:24.930
It's busy.

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:27.270
The phone says someone called, right?

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:28.310
...Yeah...

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:30.020
What's going on with P?

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:32.790
P was here just a minute ago.

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:33.520
Really?

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:37.280
Let's look for him
on our way to the station.

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:41.280
Sis's at the station too. Okay.

00:15:41.880 --> 00:15:44.280
Kirari called too.

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:45.040
Huh?

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:45.780
When did she call?

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.570
Just a minute ago.

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:50.570
I told her that you were with the police.

00:15:50.570 --> 00:15:52.290
They may have gone there.

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:54.000
I see.

00:15:54.000 --> 00:15:55.830
Thank you very much.

00:15:55.830 --> 00:15:56.780
...And...

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.420
Can anyone at the agency
come to the venue?

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:03.430
He's not here <i>either</i>!

00:16:04.720 --> 00:16:07.120
See P or Mika?

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:09.700
Sis?

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.210
Rika! Where are you?

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:11.880
Huh?

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:12.690
The station.

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:14.900
You went to the <i>station</i>?!

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.450
Why couldn't you just stay put?

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:17.690
...But you were—

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:19.190
No buts!

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:21.650
Oh! Producer!

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.240
Miria!

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:23.570
...Wait—

00:16:25.720 --> 00:16:27.230
Rika? Rika?!

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:31.000
Rika?

00:16:35.830 --> 00:16:38.500
Thank you for coming on such short notice.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.860
Have you found them yet?

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:41.710
No.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:43.590
I think we'll find them soon.

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:48.350
But if they can't make it on time,
can you three fill in until they arrive?

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:49.400
Yes.

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:51.530
Without a moment's hesitation.

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:52.100
...Um...

00:16:52.630 --> 00:16:55.350
Do we have to wear <i>those</i>?

00:16:55.700 --> 00:16:57.370
Do you have anything else?

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:58.270
What?!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.780
...I should've stayed back...

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:07.280
Wait, Producer!

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:11.740
...I'm sorry...

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.250
Miria!

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:15.470
...Wrong person...

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:19.130
Everybo'y wearin' a sui' loo's li'e P!

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:20.690
I's okay!

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.270
The next show's about to start.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.090
We've gotta go!

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:27.450
What about Producer?

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:34.060
I'm worrie' abou' him too, bu' if we keep
the au'ience wai'in', P's gonna be mad-mad.

00:17:42.860 --> 00:17:44.510
Jougasaki?

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:45.570
What are you doing here?

00:17:45.950 --> 00:17:48.240
Rika's missing because
<i>you</i> weren't watching her!

00:17:48.520 --> 00:17:49.990
What happened to her?

00:17:49.990 --> 00:17:52.130
Don't ask me!

00:17:52.130 --> 00:17:54.330
You're her producer!

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:57.050
Can't you watch her?! You idiot!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.170
Calm down.

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:00.560
Please, look at me and explain everything.

00:18:02.730 --> 00:18:05.090
Sis was really mad.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:10.590
I'll be' Mika an' P
are wai'in' for us a' the venue!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.630
An' if we hurry, we'll ma'e i' on time!

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:16.350
Girls, time to Kirarin Dash!

00:18:17.090 --> 00:18:18.350
Y-Yeah!

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:20.350
Kirarin Dash!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.270
Rika, your foot!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:27.710
Was it hurting this whole time?

00:18:28.770 --> 00:18:30.710
Fashion means bearing with it.

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.450
I have a bandage.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:33.540
Thanks.

00:18:35.150 --> 00:18:36.400
I'm sorry.

00:18:37.610 --> 00:18:40.600
You got hurt because I took
you around everywhere with me.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:45.630
We should've stayed put and waited for P.

00:18:46.350 --> 00:18:50.530
No, I shouldn't have asked
if we could get crepes.

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:52.980
P wouldn't have gotten lost, then.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:57.080
And we wouldn't have ended up like this.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.300
I'm sorry.

00:19:02.130 --> 00:19:03.270
It's okay.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:06.230
Yeah, it's not your fault, Kirari.

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:08.590
My foot's fine.

00:19:08.590 --> 00:19:09.740
Let's run for it!

00:19:10.280 --> 00:19:11.590
...But...

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:13.490
Oh, Rika, Rika!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:14.720
Huh?

00:19:18.100 --> 00:19:19.250
What do you think?

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:21.330
Well, okay.

00:19:22.350 --> 00:19:24.550
...Kirari, um...

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:26.880
Could you carry me?

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:29.800
Maybe we can't run,

00:19:30.120 --> 00:19:32.130
but we can start the show right here!

00:19:32.430 --> 00:19:35.010
That way we won't be late, right?

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.270
Let's stand way out
and get people to see us!

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:39.760
Kirari.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:40.770
Kirari.

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:41.770
Let's go!

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.190
Yeah!

00:19:46.060 --> 00:19:47.650
We were talking,
but then the call dropped.

00:19:48.230 --> 00:19:50.150
I looked around the station,
but they weren't there.

00:19:50.660 --> 00:19:52.840
I don't know what to do anymore.

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:58.160
Jougasaki, would you
mind going to the venue?

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.760
...But...

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:01.950
It is almost time for the show.

00:20:01.950 --> 00:20:08.020
If they are safe,
they will prioritize work first.

00:20:08.640 --> 00:20:09.550
What about you?

00:20:09.870 --> 00:20:13.470
...I will continue searching in case—

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:14.690
Whoa, holy crap!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.510
What's going on?

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:16.800
Let's check it out!

00:20:17.950 --> 00:20:19.010
Perhaps we should see.

00:20:26.300 --> 00:20:29.900
Shine, I know, because, I know!

00:20:29.900 --> 00:20:33.130
The future's gonna be
a hundred times happier!

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:36.320
Wave your hands, raise your voice!

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:39.410
It'll be fine because we're together!

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:41.290
Thank you very much!

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:44.330
If you want to know
what's going on, come with us!

00:20:44.330 --> 00:20:46.210
We're Dekoration!

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:48.730
Come on, everybo'y!

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:50.720
...Audience participation...

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:55.340
Oh, it's P and Sis!

00:20:57.890 --> 00:20:58.850
Sorry we're late!

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.670
We're really sorry.

00:21:00.670 --> 00:21:02.220
Thank goodness you made it.

00:21:03.140 --> 00:21:04.730
...We're saved...

00:21:04.730 --> 00:21:07.610
A valiant return, my friends.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:09.610
Get ready, you're almost on!

00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:12.800
Sorry for screaming at you earlier.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:16.800
No, it was my responsibility.

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:23.320
Um, P, I wanna apologi'e a lo' la'er, okay?

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.300
Me too!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:25.250
Me three!

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:27.490
I do too.

00:21:27.490 --> 00:21:29.000
Ready now?

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:30.220
Yeah!

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.090
...One, two...

00:21:32.090 --> 00:21:34.320
We're Dekoration!

00:21:35.770 --> 00:21:41.930
We'll try our bes' to give everybo'y
who came a lo' of happy-happy!

00:21:44.200 --> 00:21:46.460
You've got quite the crowd!

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:48.310
It's all thanks to them!

00:21:49.560 --> 00:21:52.110
It was like leading a parade!
It was really fun!

00:21:52.110 --> 00:21:54.190
We had a few problems on the way over.

00:21:54.940 --> 00:21:55.950
Problems?

00:21:56.280 --> 00:21:57.490
What happened?

00:21:57.490 --> 00:21:58.520
Not telling!

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:00.290
Come on!

00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:02.360
It was pretty rough though, wasn't it?

00:22:02.360 --> 00:22:03.450
Yeah, yeah!

00:22:03.780 --> 00:22:05.700
...But no matter what happens...

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:07.710
...you should always smile...

00:22:08.170 --> 00:22:10.330
...and be happy-happy!...

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:14.910
Or wonderful thin's'll all run away!

00:22:14.910 --> 00:22:16.440
They're doing pretty well.

00:22:16.440 --> 00:22:19.070
Yes. Even better than I expected.

00:22:19.070 --> 00:22:21.020
Why don't you try smiling too?

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:21.850
Huh?

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:22.470
Come on.

00:22:22.770 --> 00:22:23.940
Smile.

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:25.720
S-Smile?

00:22:26.890 --> 00:22:28.790
Beautiful, my friend!

00:22:28.790 --> 00:22:30.850
A malefic and sinister energy springs forth!

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:33.950
M-Malefic and sinister are bad!
